# Flame Panther

## Lore

The flame panthers are Felinoids of Omagua that come from a mutant strain with
pyrokinetic powers - one the Achilles Project never managed to reproduce, so
they became a race of their own. Before the Coming of the Rifts their powers
were roughly those of a Burster, without mega-damage flame. In the P.P.E.-rich
world since, they have become super-pyrokinetic: they wrap themselves in an
aura of fire, hurl bolts of plasma, and launch themselves across the
battlefield on controlled flame explosions that look like short flights.

Most are warriors like their cousins the hunter cats and flying tigers,
trained from childhood as defenders and usually fiercely devoted to Omagua and
to intelligent felines everywhere. Jungle dwellers, and many other felinoids,
fear them: a small squad can burn a village in minutes. The same power lets
them put out any fire at will, which makes them the finest firefighters there
are.

A flame panther is a felinoid with reddish-brown fur marked with spots or
stripes.
', 'published', 'data-script'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM imported_classes WHERE class_id = 'flame-panther');


-- Read the result back rather than trusting the exit code. d1-apply prints
-- these, and a CR in the stored markdown means the checkout mangled the file.
SELECT class_id, name, status, length(markdown) AS bytes, instr(markdown, char(13)) > 0 AS has_cr
  FROM imported_classes WHERE class_id = 'flame-panther';

